      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi:\n\nyes, we will convert as many non boot required features as modules for Android14+ kernels. yes, we should update any devices using these branches to start using the GKI modules. what is LKFT project? let me know if I can help with the switch, will be happy to do so. \n\nThanks,\nRamji",
      "parentUuid": "b56b3662_99c30ad9",
      "revId": "56afa3f145ff2d0571f152cee9dba4d5cc8aeeb3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
